   "exposures[0].target.label": "We first corroborate previous reports of MEP suppression following 500ms of TUS applied over the hand motor area (Experiments I-III; Fomenko et al., 2020; Legon et al., 2018b; Xia et al., 2021). A LMM revealed significantly lower MEP amplitudes following on-target TUS as compared to baseline for Experiment I $( b { = } { - } 0 . 1 4 , 5 \\mathsf { E } = 0 . 0 6 , t ( 1 1 ) = - 2 . 2 3 , \\mathsf { p } { = } 0 . 0 4 7 )$ , Experiment II $( b { = } { - } 0 . 1 8 , \\mathtt { S E } = 0 . 0 4 _ { i }$ , t(26) $= - 4 . 8 2 , \\mathsf { p } \\mathsf { = } 6 { \\cdot } 1 0 ^ { - 5 } )$ , and Experiment III (b=–0.22, SE = 0.07, t(15) = –3.08, p=0.008).",
